ers/H3XAGON3ST/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T10:59:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T10:59:44Z","body":"It works as expected. This PR does a good job of removing leaks, which has a very positive impact on the overall visual quality.\r\n\r\nSSAO: Off\r\nSSIL: Off\r\n## Before\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60997bde-0827-4a08-a37e-5fa581ae4a49)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/313855a6-f14d-493f-85c8-618bde462656)\r\n\r\n## After\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff3ca59d-cd95-424b-92d3-8a05235d3208)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7baf47d-f70b-4148-8430-8505c6528536)\r\n\r\nHowever, for some reason, this PR caused artifacts at the meshes junctions(?), which are most noticeable when the glow is turned on.\r\n(I apologize if I didn't make myself clear. I'm not good at English.)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03d9b858-6a96-4b8d-bf3a-82b26c5d2703)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a84a74a-cea7-4160-afb0-c23c2f3099c7)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953939085/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953946202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107254#issuecom