ot/issues/107254","id":2954031364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wEvEE","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T12:29:02Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T12:29:02Z","body":"@H3XAGON3ST if I rebake the lightmap in your project the artifacts go away, so this appears to be a hardware-related issue. I'll see what I can find, thanks for testing\r\n\r\n<img width=\"500\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a51a0692-e6db-449a-bc13-474c70eea09a\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954031364/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954075592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107254#issuecomment-2954075592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107254","id":2954075592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wE53I","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T13:19:35Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T13:19:35Z","body":"See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107179#issuecomment-2952699656 which likewise has NaN only on the reporter's system.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954075592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954084628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107254#issuecomment-2954084628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107254","id":2954084628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wE8EU","user":{"login":"H3XAGON3ST","id":83023800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDIzODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83023800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST","html_url":"https://github.com/H3XAGON3ST","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T13:38:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T21:22:57Z","body":"That's weird. I did some more testing to understand what this error might be and noticed that the artifacts are affected by the type of compression of the EXR file. Choosing \"Basic universal\" completely fixes the artifacts. 4.5 dev 5 works fine without artifacts.\r\n~~There were probably already issues before this PR, it just made them more visible.🫠~~\r\n## VRAM Compressed (Default)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ba5af0d-bb30-4c8f-9a36-01bcedc0e324)\r\n\r\n## VRAM Uncompressed\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/225ee20d-207a-49ef-ab76-4d735b96cddc)\r\n\r\n## Basis Universal\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b460e2e-f668-484e-a0a9-6aa332d2f8eb)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954084628/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954133532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107254#issuecomment-2954133532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107254","id":2954133532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wFIAc","user":{"login":"H3XAGON3ST","id":83023800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDIzODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83023800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST","html_url":"https://github.com/H3XAGON3ST","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/H3XAGON3ST/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T15:20:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T15:20:24Z","body":"@passivestar can you check the different texture compression modes? I noticed that in your test project, by default, the lightmap texture uses the BPTC_RGBFU format. This is the only format where I don't have artifacts. When the compression mode is changed to VRAM Uncompressed, the texture starts using the RGBHalf format, and artifacts appear even without rebaking the lightmap. \r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/797c664e-5ba4-482d-ad5e-bf40e9088640)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954133532/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954144929","html_url":"https://githu